    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15581" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ē-mănĕo</span></b> ,
			nsi, 2, v. n. * <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To stay without</i>, <i>remain
			beyond</i>, <i><span class="en">Stat. Th. 7, 650</span></i>.—
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Milit. t. t.</b>, <i>to stay away
				beyond one's leave of absence</i>, <i>to exceed
				one's furlough</i>, <i><span class="en">Dig. 49, 16, 3, § 4</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
